 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Peter asked the Teacher on a dusty afternoon",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How many times must I forgive my brother, is seven times enough",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus looked him in the eye and gave a gentle smile",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not seven times, my friend, but seventy-seven times",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy-seven times and then a little more",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Leave the light on in the window, keep a key beneath the door",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "'Cause the grace I've been given is the grace I'm meant to give",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy-seven times, that's the way I want to live",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a boy who took his money and he ran off to the town",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Spent it all on easy living till the money ran out",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He came walking home in rags, rehearsing what he'd say",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But his father saw him coming from a long, long way",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy-seven times and then a little more",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Leave the light on in the window, keep a key beneath the door",
   "heard": 13,
