   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "'Cause the grace I've been given is the grace I'm meant to give",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy-seven times, that's the way I want to live",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He ran to him and held him tight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Threw a party on that night",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was lost and now he's found",
